OL,3,GNEWSAPortrait of Ann Widdecombe put up
OL,4,Ain Parliament for MPs' return
OL,5,
OL,6,FA portrait of Ann Widdecombe has been
OL,7,Ferected in Parliament to remember the
OL,8,Fformer MP, who was found dead with
OL,9,Fserious head injuries last month.
OL,11,FThe picture of the ex-Conservative
OL,12,Fminister was put up on Tuesday in
OL,13,FPortcullis House, where many MPs'
OL,14,Foffices are located, in time for the
OL,15,Freturn from summer recess next week.
OL,17,FIt forms part of ongoing talks about a
OL,18,Ffitting memorial for the minister
OL,19,Fturned Reform UK spokeswoman, who died
OL,20,Faged 78 after being found in her Devon
OL,21,Fhome. Joshua Kerry, 28, has been
OL,22,Fcharged with murder.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
