OL,3,GNEWSAPortrait of Ann Widdecombe put up
OL,4,Ain Parliament for MPs' return
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelen Grant, Widdecombe's successor as
OL,7,FMP for the area of Maidstone in Kent,
OL,8,Fsaid the portrait was "the start of a
OL,9,Flasting tribute to Ann".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
